{"id":"246ebb0467f65731","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-ls-upward.md","title":"Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","display":"thm-ls-upward — Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-ls-upward","aliases":["57-thm-ls-upward"],"display":"thm-ls-upward — Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[57-df-cardinal]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-ls-upward"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-ls-upward</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ls-upward — Löwenheim-Skolem Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a7fe4775125052f\" href=\"?note=6a7fe4775125052f\" title=\"57-df-elementary-substructure\">57-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\\leq|A|\">\\(\\aleph_0\\leq|A|\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为基数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\\{|A|,|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\">\\(\\max\\{|A|,|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq\">\\(\\preccurlyeq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6a7fe4775125052f\" href=\"?note=6a7fe4775125052f\" title=\"57-df-elementary-substructure\">57-df-elementary-substructure</a>。保留旧符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|S\\|\">\\(\\|S\\|\\)</span>，在本文件固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\">\\(\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\|S\\|\\coloneqq\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\|S\\|\\coloneqq\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\land\\mathfrak A\\preccurlyeq\\mathfrak B\\land||\\mathfrak B||=\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathfrak B\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak B,S)\\land\\mathfrak A\\preccurlyeq\\mathfrak B\\land||\\mathfrak B||=\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由原结构的初等图加上所需多个互異新常量应用紧致性，再取适当大小的初等子结构并沿嵌入搬运。无限性是必要前提，有限结构不具有任意大初等扩张。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"6a7fe4775125052f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 且 $\\aleph_0\\leq|A|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$\\kappa$ 为基数，$\\max\\{|A|,|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa$，见 [[57-df-cardinal]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\preccurlyeq$ 见 [[57-df-elementary-substructure]]。保留旧符号 $\\|S\\|$，在本文件固定为 $\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"a7a345348b1a1d3a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$ 且 $\\aleph_0\\leq|A|$，见 [[57-df-structure]]。$\\kappa$ 为基数，$\\max\\{|A|,|S|,\\aleph_0\\}\\leq\\kappa$，见 [[57-df-cardinal]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\preccurlyeq$ 见 [[57-df-elementary-substructure]]。保留旧符号 $\\|S\\|$，在本文件固定为 $\\max\\{|S|,\\aleph_0\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol